+/** One statement for a whole page of claim ids, not one statement per claim - see
+ * migrations/0011_claims_tenant_indexes.sql for the index this relies on, and
+ * src/db/repositories/documents.ts's `getDocumentsForClaims` for the caller. Ordered by
+ * `(claim_id, created_at)` so rows for the same claim arrive together and in a stable order,
+ * matching the index exactly. */
+export const GET_DOCUMENTS_FOR_CLAIMS =
+  "SELECT * FROM documents WHERE claim_id = ANY($1) ORDER BY claim_id, created_at"
